<TextPage title="Disclaimer | FinForecast" heading="Disclaimer" description="FinForecast forecasts are statistical estimates for information only, not investment advice.">
  <h2>Not investment advice</h2>
  <p>
    The forecasts, technical analysis and other content on FinForecast are produced by statistical models for general information
    only. They are not investment, financial, tax or legal advice, and they are not a recommendation to buy, sell or hold any asset.
  </p>

  <h2>Forecasts can be wrong</h2>
  <p>
    Models are based on past prices and cannot anticipate future events. Actual prices can differ substantially from any forecast
    or range shown. Past performance does not guarantee future results. The measured accuracy of the models is published on the
    <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a> page.
  </p>

  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    Investing involves risk, including the loss of your capital. Consider your own circumstances and, where appropriate, consult
    a licensed financial adviser before making investment decisions. FinForecast accepts no liability for any loss arising from
    the use of this site.
  </p>

  <h2>Data</h2>
  <p>
    Market data is supplied by third parties (Twelve Data, Alpha Vantage) and may contain errors or delays. Daily highs and lows for
    silver are estimates. We do not guarantee the accuracy or completeness of any data.
  </p>
</TextPage>
